.checkbox {
	display: inline-flex;
	vertical-align: text-bottom;
	width: 16;
	height: 16;
	background-size: 16px;
	margin-left: 2px;
	margin-right: 5px;
}

.checkbox-on {
	background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3Csvg%20width%3D%2216%22%20height%3D%2216%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2016%2016%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%0A%3Crect%20width%3D%2216%22%20height%3D%2216%22%20fill%3D%22%2358A9D7%22%2F%3E%0A%3Cpath%20d%3D%22M6.71429%2012.2852L14%204.9995L12.7143%203.71436L6.71429%209.71378L3.28571%206.2831L2%207.57092L6.71429%2012.2852Z%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E");
}

.checkbox-off {
	background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;charset=UTF-8,%3Csvg%20width%3D%2216%22%20height%3D%2216%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2016%2016%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%3E%0A%3Crect%20x%3D%220.75%22%20y%3D%220.75%22%20width%3D%2214.5%22%20height%3D%2214.5%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20stroke%3D%22%2336352F%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.5%22%2F%3E%0A%3C%2Fsvg%3E");
}
	
</style></head><body class="pdf ko-KR" lang="ko-KR"><article id="334924f6-8abb-8044-a14e-da2b38921a43" class="page sans"><header><h1 class="page-title" dir="auto">6주차</h1><p class="page-description" dir="auto"></p></header><div class="page-body"><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="340924f6-8abb-80ad-96ee-edf308bb454d"><div class="source"><a href="https://www.notion.so/signed/attachment%3A2bbf519f-b1dd-4cf8-afe9-de958250ac50%3A%EB%94%A5%EB%9F%AC%EB%8B%9D_%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%B4%ED%86%A0%EC%B9%98_%EA%B5%90%EA%B3%BC%EC%84%9C_17%EC%9E%A5.pdf?table=block&amp;id=340924f6-8abb-80ad-96ee-edf308bb454d&amp;spaceId=df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb&amp;userId=753b29c0-0b28-4729-bb40-797c6a3afad3&amp;cache=v2">딥러닝 파이토치 교과서 1~7장.pdf</a></div></figure></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h1 id="334924f6-8abb-806f-8aad-e101d1d855c3" class=""><strong>[딥러닝 파이토치 교과서] 6장</strong></h1></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h2 id="340924f6-8abb-80a7-8f95-cf626a6a9e5a" class="">6.1.1 ResNet</h2></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-807c-88b3-c4760efdf433" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">MS에서 개발한 알고리즘</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8002-aff4-f809af79997c" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">핵심: 깊어진 신경망을 효과적으로 학습하기 위한 방법으로 <mark class="highlight-yellow_background">residual</mark> 고안</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80bd-9dd4-e381d11f1ba1" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">Deep Residual Learning for Image Recognition 논문에 따르면, 신경망은 깊어질수록 성능이 좋아지다가, <mark class="highlight-red_background">일정 단계에 도달하면 성능이 나빠진다! </mark><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="340924f6-8abb-808d-b3f2-d4141bd8ba3c" class="image"><img style="width:703.9937744140625px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/a471c14c-3689-4166-80cc-90e