t-style-type:circle">병목블록(bottleneck block): 파라미터 수가 계속 증가하는 것을 막음<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="340924f6-8abb-8052-8283-d674157a9149" class="">합성곱층의 채널 수를 조절하면서, 차원을 줄였다가 늘릴 수 있기 때문</p></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8001-9849-fc0d9dfc6614" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">identity mapping(shortcut, skip connection)<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="340924f6-8abb-80c5-b6d5-f359641d80c6" class="">입력 <style>@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.25/dist/katex-swap.min.css')</style><span data-token-index="0" contenteditable="false" class="notion-text-equation-token" style="user-select:all;-webkit-user-select:all;-moz-user-select:all"><span></span><span><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span></span></span><span>﻿</span></span>가 어떤 함수를 통과하더라도, 다시 <style>@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.25/dist/katex-swap.min.css')</style><span data-token-index="0" contenteditable="false" class="notion-text-equation-token" style="user-select:all;-webkit-user-select:all;-moz-user-select:all"><span></span><span><span class="katex"><span class="katex-mathml"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex"> x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class="katex-html" aria-hidden="true"><span class="base"><span class="strut" style="height:0.4306em;"></span><span class="mord mathnormal">x</span></span></span></span></span><span>﻿</span></span>라는 형태로 출력되도록 함</p></div><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="340924f6-8abb