0924f6-8abb-8026-a141-c6971b01cf3d" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">정확도 낮음</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8040-b548-fa242683c339" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">YOLO, SSD 계열</li></ul></div></li></ol></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="340924f6-8abb-8025-b490-d89cb6999388" class="numbered-list" start="2"><li>2-stage detector<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8090-9ebe-f20aa65e6a44" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">분류, 위치 검출을 순차적으로 진행함</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8062-9eb3-daaf81f46b58" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">속도 느림</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8049-82b2-e5427b2ab40e" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">정확도 높음</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80de-88cc-c3a3df4bd9bd" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">R-CNN 계열</li></ul></div></li></ol></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-800d-b30e-ee7024a4a427" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">활용 분야: 자율 주행 자동차, CCTV, 무인 점포</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h2 id="340924f6-8abb-8092-b01e-dc92060c2985" class="">6.2.1 R-CNN</h2></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h3 id="340924f6-8abb-8073-b964-e6de810eac00" class="">과거의 객체 인식 알고리즘</h3></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80c3-ab83-f538975061ac" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">슬라이딩 윈도우 방식: 일정한 크기를 가진 window로 이미지의 모든 영역을 탐색하면서 객체 검출</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8047-b985-e0aba44e33c5" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">단점: 비효율적</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h3 id="340924f6-8abb-80fc-9a89-c4e4431828bf" class="">현재</h3></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80ec-9804-f1ae52c5e13d" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">선택적 탐색(selective search) 알고리즘을 적용한 후보 영역 알고리즘(region proposal) 많이 사용</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-808d-8442-e951b4ee48ae" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">region proposal: 영상, 이미지에서 객체가 있을 법한 영역</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h3 id="340924f6-8abb-8026-9171-d1160793878b" class="">선택적 탐색</h3></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80b8-a9d3-faaa158e862e" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">객체 인식, 검출을 위한 가능한 후보 영역을 알아내는방법</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80df-a838-f40de1615359" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">분할 방식 → seed 선정 → seed에 대해 완전 탐색 적용 </li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8089-8783-d3a093ee626e" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">용어<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80cc-9346-c0cf2c3f00c5" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">완전 탐색(exhaustive search): 후보가 될만한 대상의 크기, 비율이 모두 다른 상황을 고려해 후보 영역을 찾는 방법</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-809f-bf66-e61e089c0d97" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">분할(segmentation): 영상 데이터의 특성에 따라 분할 → 후보 영역 선정</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8070-be09-d5141ecd8876" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">후보영역(bounding box): 3D 객체의 형태를 모두 포함할 수 있는 최소 크기의 박스</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-802e-ae13-c20d5ad0333a" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">seed: 특정 기준점이 되는 픽셀<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="340924f6-8abb-805d-b65d-c8849b64538b" class="">영상에서는 특정 기준점의 픽셀에서 점점 의미가 같은 영상 범위까지 픽셀을 확장하면서 분할함</p></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8079-8d1b-e5550be759fb" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">단계<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="340924f6-8abb-803b-a8e8-c1d811d0095a" class="numbered-list" start="1"><li>초기 영역 생성 (sub-segmentation)<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="340924f6-8abb-8018-a548-e6184bd071b1" class="">입력된 이미지를 여러 영역으로 분할</p></div><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="340924f6-8abb-805f-9252-ecd3d5f608c0" class="image"><img style="width:512.9874877929688px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/de2bd284-0673-426f-8bb3-dfafcd72ca30/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%2FAwhzEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMg2KNvBz3RQV56lgmKtwDJRhMZKT3LoJeNRnhrkwAoAYPohKZ140R7EypMaau4S7Wus42jNMlj1f64ohqBi4B4a2j%2Fqi8JN9dNIhJUmir%2BOuIkllNdwBIexyIfMcXNXSwgpm61R09uA3O7Jz6gY8CN6tFr8tGA45bLcHddlFyre8XIQ3bXB3NMmSiC9XqU%2BiLnjDcMWcTp28r4vJORAQYC%2BSYvsFL2Fm6HKc8VXwGV5iV8tiwU8QYbsjzVP3521JKQlC0kGCamUOn2u627soELojOPg0xolyz4ixpb6UVTUtRFZdj6ps2WsMlhIn3EsKTB4WL14zrk6bWsrVO8gnSsYr9WdSMw6vSCaJjM2K3A3QDmb6sxuZXN3IfRsBLsSeV2xHN9AOcwEjbqLDCq2Pqk3FlsoqEzRKOWJrxnMna%2BymHjhSMCfv4lAE5U3vy9bccrk3E0hXuffauPR35w%2BltaPK%2Fwgx2jvnbJqKmfXEWkcmRdsA1ty9vJR49g8dk0zNVK%2FAyBmaVk9gWKonAQw6%2BkaVy1X4h1Zt37QYLQG5152QGJ8aIflMO2JaHzw%2FWG8PgH2kEucC19nRDPfJh5r0RHGk8E1Fx%2FZqDTBJyCyWzdBYRCk%2FBU31qtVXlFbUQO60kc9xZkce%2Fj8WsSf0w64PzzgY6pgEg9cLYF3VweqjgVsNCb4SkWuuWg%2B%2