한 성능을 보인 CNN 기반 모델(AlexNet, VGG16, GoogLeNet)을 변형시켜 이미지 분할에 적합하도록 만든 네틍뤄크</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8027-9b72-dbe7c22aa51f" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">장점: 합성곱층으로 사용됨 → 입력 이미지 크기 제약 사라짐</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-803c-9c71-e9a0af30cabd" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">단점<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8059-a64f-d76a57c3699f" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">여러 단계의 합성곱층, 풀링층 거침 ⇒ 해상도 저하</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8034-9cfc-f78ed25d0714" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">낮아진 해상도 → upsampling 방식으로 복원 ⇒ 이미지의 세부 정보 손실</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h2 id="340924f6-8abb-80f2-bf73-d98110048d6c" class="">6.3.2 합성곱 &amp; 역합성곱 네트워크</h2></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-803b-9a1c-ec1fee35fabc" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">완전 합성곱 네트워크의 문제점 해결하기 위해 등장</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8062-b5b1-faeda3a38078" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">역합성곱 (upsampling)<div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341924f6-8abb-80af-8d9c-fc4c4db27875" class="image"><img style="width:545.7875366210938px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/995f4037-e7ff-4329-932f-e9d3a3d5323e/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%