 id="341924f6-8abb-80a3-8193-d4429f34096a" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">합성곱</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h2 id="340924f6-8abb-8072-8172-ed13bf5d126a" class="">6.3.3 U-Net</h2></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-80ca-bab3-ccca8ff6972d" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">바이오 메디컬 이미지 분할을 위한 합성곱 신경망</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8088-97e3-d848666149a3" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">특징<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8094-87ee-d4860acab7fc" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">빠른 속도<div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341924f6-8abb-808d-a4b5-cdef1427b977" class="image"><img style="width:507.76251220703125px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/209a3705-d9e2-4396-b2dd-a7e0e9ac5a63/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%2FAwhzEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMg2KNvBz3RQV56lgmKtwDJRhMZKT3LoJeNRnhrkwAoAYPohKZ140R7EypMaau4S7Wus42jNMlj1f64ohqBi4B4a2j%2Fqi8JN9dNIhJUmir%2BOuIkllNdwBIexyIfMcXNXSwgpm61R09uA3O7Jz6gY8CN6tFr8tGA45bLcHddlFyre8XIQ3bXB3NMmSiC9XqU%2BiLnjDcMWcTp28r4vJORAQYC%2BSYvsFL2Fm6HKc8VXwGV5iV8tiwU8QYbsjzVP3521JKQlC0kGCamUOn2u627soELojOPg0xolyz4ixpb6UVTUtRFZdj6ps2WsMlhIn3EsKTB4WL14zrk6bWsrVO8gnSsYr9WdSMw6vSCaJjM2K3A3QDmb6sxuZXN3IfRsBLsSeV2xHN9AOcwEjbqLDCq2Pqk3FlsoqEzRKOWJrxnMna%2BymHjhSMCfv4lAE5U3vy9bccrk3E0hXuffauPR35w%2BltaPK%2Fwgx2jvnbJqKmfXEWkcmRdsA1ty9vJR49g8dk0zNVK%2FAyBmaVk9gWKonAQw6%2BkaVy1X4h1Zt37QY