ontents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8044-917e-c579dc028a73" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">지역화란? 객체의 위치 정보를 출력해주는 것. 바운딩 박스를 많이 사용함</li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8068-8cbb-de9d0c7c5610" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">구조<div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341924f6-8abb-8024-9b6b-c9ffd0541f6d" class="image"><img style="width:518.0952380952382px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/0ce38f83-692c-4266-b914-06fce85f3852/42231ca0-5fec-4115-b84f-b6eba08d9c52.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%2FAwhzEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMg2KNvBz3RQV56lgmKtwDJRhMZKT3LoJeNRnhrkwAoAYPohKZ140R7EypMaau4S7Wus42jNMlj1f64ohqBi4B4a2j%2Fqi8JN9dNIhJUmir%2BOuIkllNdwBIexyIfMcXNXSwgpm61R09uA3O7Jz6gY8CN6tFr8tGA45bLcHddlFyre8XIQ3bXB3NMmSiC9XqU%2BiLnjDcMWcTp28r4vJORAQYC%2BSYvsFL2Fm6HKc8VXwGV5iV8tiwU8QYbsjzVP3521JKQlC0kGCamUOn2u627soELojOPg0xolyz4ixpb6UVTUtRFZdj6ps2WsMlhIn3EsKTB4WL14zrk6bWsrVO8gnSsYr9WdSMw6vSCaJjM2K3A3QDmb6sxuZXN3IfRsBLsSeV2xHN9AOcwEjbqLDCq2Pqk3FlsoqEzRKOWJrxnMna%2BymHjhSMCfv4lAE5U3vy9bccrk3E0hXuffauPR35w%2BltaPK%2Fwgx2jvnbJqKmfXEWkcmRdsA1ty9vJR49g8dk0zNVK%2FAyBmaVk9gWKonAQw6%2BkaVy1X4h1Zt37QYLQG5152QGJ8aIflMO2JaHzw%2FWG8PgH2kEucC19nRDPfJh5r0RHGk8E1Fx%2FZqDTBJyCyWzdBYRCk%2FBU31qtVXlFbUQO60kc9xZkce%2Fj8WsSf0w64PzzgY6pgEg9cLYF3VweqjgVsNCb4SkWuuWg%2B%2FQePI68%2Fgsmu1lBBWav%2FPcOjFEAV99sMB403l52YH8ECTK2kA9J76BuKCaJk%2B0rsuMbvU%2Bs5JH4r9%2BBnJ298l0t3Dxl6qyBJrEqhAs3BLD2fR21w5G6%2BaJ%2F7roENprYOobZyl%2F6g2THnj9ad8Q3arGN8qGOQ9SwBiNw%2BG0i0x3QLek83KAAZtCwpq11ZHPGcko&amp;X-Amz-Signature=6fc94b383fc82863e25c5bdacd45eaa2ac235435b124eadf0980399194aa738c&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject"/></figure></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80f5-8292-fa167c3d860c" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">FCN 기반으로 구축되었음</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8002-98dd-cb8e7319ec15" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">크기가 다양한 이미지의 객체 분할을 위해 크기가 다양한 특성 맵을 병합할 수 있도록 down sampling과 up sampling을 순서대로 반복하는 구조</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80fa-8ed1-cedeae6f4791" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">수축 경로 (contracting path)<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8094-b57f-e8ff7dd10351" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">컨텍스트 포착</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80fb-b91a-d4284baac2c1" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">확장 경로 (expansive path)<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-803a-8390-c5de32a559fb" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">특성 맵을 upsampling</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-809f-9a2d-de2f0242fc95" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">수축 경로에서 포착된 특성 맵의 컨텍스트와 결합 ⇒ 정확한 지역화 수행</li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80ff-af50-f78da6363127" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:circle">합성곱<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-801c-87b3-e0e12edbdd5f" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">3x3 합성곱 두 개</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-804f-ac77-f2f0c775eadb" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">그 사이에 드롭아웃(dropout)</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80b6-8c8d-efa1addcd01a" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square">각 블록은 최대 풀링(maxpooling) 이용해서 크기를 줄여서 다음 블록으로 넘어감</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8006-9a7c-f2430d2d93e2" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:square"><code>up-conv</code> : 수축 과정에서 줄어든 크기를 다시 키워서 합성곱 블록 이용</li></ul></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h2 id="340924f6-8abb-8008-b311-c5f987199be0" class="">6.3.4 PSPNet</h2></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="340924f6-8abb-8042-ace3-eb095633d058" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">시맨틱 분할 알고리즘 (semantic segmentation)</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-802f-8e2a-efc32767e8d2" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">완전 연결층의 한계를 극복하기 위해 피라미드 풀링 모듈을 추가함</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80af-b595-e9d775b5beb1" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">훈련 과정<div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341924f6-8abb-8005-ba6f-ef3c3c149e15" class="image"><img style="width:665.9874877929688px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/8cd77f61-80cc-4ca5-9ab8-4f0d2ba5701b/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%2FAwhzEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMg2KNvBz3RQV56lgmKtwDJRhMZKT3LoJeNRnhrkwAoAYPohKZ140R7EypMaau4S7Wus42jNMlj1f64ohqBi4B4a2j%2Fqi8JN9dNIhJUmir%2BOuIkllNdwBIexyIfMcXNXSwgpm61R09uA3O7Jz6gY8CN6tFr8tGA45bLcHddlFyre8XIQ3bXB3NMmSiC9XqU%2BiLnjDcMWcTp28r4vJORAQYC%2BSYvsFL2Fm6HKc8VXwGV5iV8tiwU8QYbsjzVP3521JKQlC0kGCamUOn2u627soELojOPg0xolyz4ixpb6UVTUtRFZdj6ps2WsMlhIn3EsKTB4WL14zrk6bWsrVO8gnSsYr9WdSMw6vSCaJjM2K3A3QDmb6sxuZXN3IfRsBLsSeV2xHN9AOcwEjbqLDCq2Pqk3FlsoqEzRKOWJrxnMna%2BymHjhSMCfv4lAE5U3vy9bccrk3E0hXuffauPR35w%2BltaPK%2Fwgx2jvnbJqKmfXEWkcmRdsA1ty9vJR49g8dk0zNVK%2FAyBmaVk9gWKonAQw6%2BkaVy1X4h1Zt37QYLQG5152QGJ8aIflMO2JaHzw%2FWG8PgH2kEucC19nRDPfJh5r0RHGk8E1Fx%2FZqDTBJyCyWzdBYRCk%2FBU31qtVXlFbUQO60kc9xZkce%2Fj8WsSf0w64PzzgY6pgEg9cLYF3VweqjgVsNCb4SkWuuWg%2B%2FQePI68%2Fgsmu1lBBWav%2FPcOjFEAV99sMB403l52YH8ECTK2kA9J76BuKCaJk%2B0rsuMbvU%2Bs5JH4r9%2BBnJ298l0t3Dxl6qyBJrEqhAs3BLD2fR21w5G6%2BaJ%2F7roENprYOobZyl%2F6g2THnj9ad8Q3arGN8qGOQ9SwBiNw%2BG0i0x3QLek83KAAZtCwpq11ZHPGcko&amp;X-Amz-Signature=3c6384bd5e0e004a5908ff14df467d06d8b2a93d3159cf8f27525e500b840583&amp;X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&amp;x-amz-checksum-mode=ENABLED&amp;x-id=GetObject"/></figure></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="341924f6-8abb-8054-9846-eeecabc3d2bd" class="numbered-list" start="1"><li>이미지 출력이 서로 다른 크기가 되도록 여러 차례 풀링<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341924f6-8abb-8061-bb9f-ee63f21f21c8" class="">1 x 1, 2 x 2, 3 x 3, 6 x 6 크기로 풀링 수행</p></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341924f6-8abb-8071-ad4b-c6d6033e6621" class="">1 x 1 특성 맵에 가장 광범위한 정보 담음</p></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341924f6-8abb-80a0-8445-f948868ae0f7" class="">다른 크기의 특성 맵은 서로 다른 영역들의 정보를 담음</p></div></li></ol></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="341924f6-8abb-80b3-9488-efbc3eaa8f92" class="numbered-list" start="2"><li>1 x 1 합성곱을 사용해 채널 수 조정<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341924f6-8abb-809b-b01b-c01d92ce2b68" class="">풀링층 개수 = N, 출력 채널 수 = 입력 채널 수 / N</p></div></li></ol></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="341924f6-8abb-80ce-8cf3-ea77320283a8" class="numbered-list" start="3"><li>모듈 입력 크기에 맞게 특성 맵을 업 샘플링<div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><p id="341924f6-8abb-80eb-87ba-c3e3ba8a8465" class="">bilinear interpolation(양산형 보간법) 사용</p></div></li></ol></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ol type="1" id="341924f6-8abb-8062-86c1-f74bced426d6" class="numbered-list" start="4"><li>원래의 특성맵고 1~3과정에서 생성한 새로운 특성 맵들을 병합</li></ol></div></li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><h4 id="341924f6-8abb-80ef-81d1-c5cc0763c545" class="">Interpolation (보간법)</h4></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80db-b141-df03a4f47fe6" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">빈 화소에 값을 할당 ⇒ 좋은 품질의 영상을 만드는 방법</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-80da-a18a-e5c8f3a6ee57" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">선형 보간법 (linear interpolation): 원시 영상의 화소 값 두개 사용 ⇒ 원하는 좌표에서 새로운 화소 값을 계산</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="auto"><ul id="341924f6-8abb-8013-940f-ce7f7ebff6fb" class="bulleted-list"><li style="list-style-type:disc">양선형 보간법(bilinear interpoliation): 화소당 선형 보간을 3번 수행 ⇒ 새롭게 생성된 화소는 가장 가까운 화소 4개에 가중치를 곱한 값을 합해서 얻음</li></ul></div><div style="display:contents" dir="ltr"><figure id="341924f6-8abb-80e6-83a5-fbfe9f76518b" class="image"><img style="width:703.9937744140625px" src="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/df75b261-8887-4f5d-af69-bf4f5296a6fb/e04ac182-46e4-4ee1-a63a-55fa4c91e6ec/image.png?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466QUSBZFGW%2F20260413%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;X-Amz-Date=20260413T112906Z&amp;X-Amz-Expires=21600&amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEKr%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJGMEQCIDNsaiCMF%2Fyxv3VrARwFDQx8U5nOJFKi8TXlbWWe9OSrAiAIDja8606aKyHM5SHcqGESFf5kQpLdtC8xx8ZNuv9PPSr%2FAwhzEAAaDDYzNzQyMzE4MzgwNSIMg2KNvBz3RQV56lgmKtwDJRhMZKT3LoJeNRnhrkwAoAYPo